{
  "run_id": "PMC12941970__problem_constrained__pcd_D_o3mini__s1",
  "auditor": "trapi:gpt-5.6-sol_2026-07-09",
  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "The starting material is a homogeneous, unreinforced CoCrFeNi high-entropy alloy produced by casting or powder-metallurgy consolidation.",
      "field": "material_initial_state",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Adding 1–3 at.% W and applying controlled pre-oxidation will promote tungsten segregation and oxidation at the sliding surface.",
      "field": "intervention",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will produce an in situ WO3 tribofilm during sliding.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Sliding in oxygen-containing air can generate an adaptive oxidized surface layer.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC8448869::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The WO3 film will be thin, continuous, and strongly adherent, with minimal delamination.",
      "field": "structural_mediator",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "WO3 has intrinsically low shear strength under the proposed sliding conditions.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The low-shear WO3 layer will reduce friction.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "A dense surface oxide can impede continued oxidation of an underlying alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "The WO3 layer will act as a barrier to wear of the underlying CoCrFeNi-based alloy.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC10456374::web::000::abstract",
        "PMC8448869::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "An adaptive wear-generated surface structure can yield a friction coefficient near 0.1 in air.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8448869::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Pre-oxidation will control oxide-formation kinetics and ensure uniform WO3 development from room temperature through 800 °C.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The intervention will maintain low friction and wear throughout the complete room-temperature-to-800 °C range.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will achieve a coefficient of friction of approximately 0.1–0.15.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8448869::web::003::introduction"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "Untreated CoCrFeNi typically has a coefficient of friction greater than 0.3 under the proposed conditions.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The modified alloy will have a lower wear rate than untreated CoCrFeNi over the entire test-temperature range.",
      "field": "predicted_outcome",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The baseline alloy's wear arises from direct metal–metal contact, oxidation, and elevated-temperature softening.",
      "field": "baseline",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The proposed behavior is expected in ambient air at loads of 10–20 N from room temperature to 800 °C.",
      "field": "boundary",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Failure to obtain the targeted friction reduction, a continuous WO3 layer, or reduced wear relative to the control is designated as falsifying the hypothesis.",
      "field": "falsification_experiment.falsification_rule",
      "needs_support": false,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    }
  ],
